# 🌱 Eco World

**Eco World** is a modern full-stack eco-friendly eCommerce platform built with the MERN stack and Next.js. The platform allows users to discover, purchase, and manage sustainable products while providing administrators with powerful tools to manage products, orders, customers, and analytics.


---

## 📖 Project Overview

Eco World is designed to promote sustainable living by offering environmentally friendly products through a clean, modern, and user-friendly shopping experience.

Users can browse products, add items to their cart or wishlist, securely place orders, and track purchases. Administrators can manage products, categories, users, orders, and overall store performance from a dedicated dashboard.

---

## ✨ Features

### Customer Features

* User Registration & Login
* Secure Authentication (Better Auth)
* Browse Products
* Search Products
* Filter & Sort Products
* Product Details
* Shopping Cart
* Wishlist
* Checkout
* Order Tracking
* Review & Rating
* Profile Management
* Payment History
* Notifications
* Responsive Dashboard

### Admin Features

* Admin Dashboard
* Product Management (CRUD)
* Category Management
* Order Management
* Customer Management
* Review Management
* Inventory Management
* Sales Analytics
* Revenue Statistics
* Website Settings

---

## 🌍 Eco-Friendly Features

* Sustainable Product Collection
* Eco-Friendly Categories
* Green Shopping Experience
* Eco Reward Points (Coming Soon)
* Carbon Footprint Awareness (Coming Soon)

