## 🛠 Tech Stack

### Frontend

* Next.js
* React.js
* JavaScript
* Tailwind CSS
* HeroUI
* charts
*agentic AI
* Framer Motion
* React Hot Toast

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB
* Better Auth

### Database

* MongoDB Atlas



